# Employee-Resource-Management-System

Overview

The Employee & Resource Management System is a RESTful API built using Python and FastAPI to manage employees, projects, resources, and their assignments.

The application provides CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations for managing organizational information and connecting employees with projects and resources.
